From 817ed19dd4122180992a807ae4380e4c7da95044 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 22:24:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(import): read Sales Navigator style exports without
 emails
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- map profile / company LinkedIn URL columns (EN and ES) and keep a
  LinkedIn address from becoming the company domain
- «Nombre» + «Apellidos» now gives the full name
- create and dedupe the person without an email (LinkedIn URL, else
  name inside the account); another person at the same company is
  a new lead instead of overwriting the first
- store the company LinkedIn page on the account when empty

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013oUyrHdHaQ4SjMaiyKsvHA
